  "notes": "{酒|さけ} means both Japanese sake (rice wine) and alcohol in general.\n\nTYPES OF ALCOHOL:\n- ⟦{日本酒|にほんしゅ}→日本酒：12954_nihonshu⟧: Japanese sake (rice wine)\n- ⟦{焼酎|しょうちゅう}→焼酎：19874_shouchuu⟧: shochu (distilled spirit)\n- ⟦{梅酒|うめしゅ}→梅酒：16869_umeshu⟧: plum wine\n- ⟦{洋酒|ようしゅ}→洋酒：27829_youshu⟧: Western liquor\n- ⟦ビール→ビール：01015_biiru⟧: beer\n\nSAKE SERVING STYLES:\n- ⟦{熱燗|あつかん}→熱燗：27548_atsukan⟧: hot sake\n- ⟦{冷|ひ}や→冷や：28141_hiya⟧: room temperature sake\n- ⟦{冷酒|れいしゅ}→冷酒：27547_reishu⟧: chilled sake\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {酒|さけ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{飲|の}む→飲む：00322_nomu⟧: to drink alcohol\n- {酒|さけ}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{強|つよ}い→強い：00820_tsuyoi⟧: can hold one's liquor\n- {酒|さけ}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{弱|よわ}い→弱い：00825_yowai⟧: can't hold one's liquor\n- ⟦{居酒屋|いざかや}→居酒屋：09635_izakaya⟧: izakaya (Japanese pub)",
